      "content": "That makes sense. One more thing—how should we handle \"hidden\" risks? I'm worried about the supplier acting in bad faith or being dishonest about their capacity/reserves. Are there specific clauses or audit rights we can put in to catch those kinds of shady operators before they cause real damage?",
